      "text": "Let $x = e^z,$ where $z$ is a real number. We then have\n\\begin{align*}\n\\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{1}{x^{2^n} - x^{-2^n}} &= \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{1}{e^{2^nz} - e^{-2^nz}} \\\\\n&= \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{1}{e^{2^nz} - e^{-2^nz}} \\cdot \\frac{e^{2^nz} - e^{-2^nz}}{e^{2^nz} - e^{-2^nz}} \\\\\n&= \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{e^{2^nz} - e^{-2^nz}}{(e^{2^nz})^2 - (e^{-2^nz})^2} \\\\\n&= \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{e^{2^nz} - e^{-2^nz}}{e^{4^nz} - e^{-4^nz}} \\\\\n&= \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{(e^{2^nz} - e^{-2^nz})(e^{2^{n + 1}z} + e^{-2^{n + 1}z})}{(e^{4^nz} - e^{-4^nz})(e^{2^{n + 1}z} + e^{-2^{n + 1}z})} \\\\\n&= \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{e^{2^{n + 1}z} + e^{-2^{n + 1}z} - e^{-2^{n + 1}z} - e^{2^{n + 1}z}}{(e^{2^{n + 1}z} - e^{-2^{n + 1}z})(e^{2^{n + 1}z} + e^{-2^{n + 1}z})} \\\\\n&= \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{2e^{-2^{n + 1}z}}{4e^{2^{n + 1}z}} \\\\\n&= \\sum_{n = 0}^\\infty \\frac{1}{2^z e^{2^{n + 1}z}} \\\\\n&= \\boxed{2^{1-z}}.\n\\end{align*}. The answer is 2^{1-z}",
